<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Energy Drain</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 38), Dark Knight (guild level 85)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast energy drain &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast energy drain</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>You lay hands on the target and drain their energy. For a while, from a 
minute up to several minutes, they lose 5 points of strength and 5 of 
constitution. Worse, they lose 500 experience points, and those don't come 
back.
</p><p>A life protection spell on the target stops the drain, once; the protection 
is used up. Someone already drained can't be drained again until it wears 
off. The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail; either way, 
casting it starts a fight. It is also found on wands, staffs and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Life Protection</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Experience</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>